# INK2 income tax return as SRU files (planned, milestone M6)
#
# This file only pins down what is known so far. The field lists are generated
# later from SKV's xls files (one per form and year) by a converter tool:
#   ink2r.field.<code>.title / .type / .required / .rule
#   bas_to_sru.<code>.accounts  from BAS "INK2 P1 intervall" (free from bas.se)

